## Self Run, Not Self Serve

Self run only describes what happens after our crew leaves, not the setup itself. What changes versus our technician backed packages is who operates the system once the party starts: with the Eco Pack, that is you, not us. If your event genuinely needs someone on site all night, a big band, a longer program of speeches, more than 50 guests, the Wedding Pack or MICE Pack are built for that instead. For a private party at home, in a garden or on a terrace, self run is usually the right fit and the more affordable one.

As Carlos Göttsch put it in a 5-star Google review (September 2025): "I would like to thank Malaga Event Gear for their prompt and absolutely reliable assistance. Without you, our party would not have been possible."

## Optional Extras for the Moment That Matters

Two real add ons exist on top of the base Eco Pack, and neither is bundled in by default:

-   **Projector and projection screen (+50 euros)**: useful for a photo slideshow or a video montage at a milestone birthday or anniversary, projected onto a screen rather than a phone passed around the table.
-   **Professional smoke/fog machine (+20 euros)**: for a dance floor moment or a cake reveal under the RGBW lighting, once the more formal part of the evening is done.

Neither add on changes the guest count ceiling or adds a technician. They are exactly what is listed on the [Eco Pack page](/packages/eco/), nothing more.

## Booking and Service Area

Our services focus on Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros. Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability. Confirm your venue type, villa, private room or terrace, and whether mains power is on site, so our crew can size the cable run correctly.

