## FAQs

### What is included in audio visual rental for a private party?

The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) includes 2 high quality active speakers with stands, 1 wired dynamic microphone, 2 RGBW LED light bars, and aesthetic cabling with professional setup, for 290 euros ex VAT, up to 50 guests.

### Is a technician included for a private party?

No, not by default. Our crew delivers, installs and tests the Eco Pack on site, then it runs self run for the rest of the event, without a technician standing by. A technician is included on our Wedding Pack and MICE Pack, though those are sized and priced for a wedding or corporate event rather than a private party.

### How many guests can the Eco Pack support?

Up to 50 guests. That is the real ceiling on this package, matched to a villa garden, a private room or a terrace, not a larger celebration.

### What extras are available for a private party?

A projector and projection screen (+50 euros), useful for a photo slideshow or video montage, and a professional smoke/fog machine (+20 euros), for a dance floor moment or a cake reveal. Both are optional add ons, not part of the base package.

### Can I use this setup for karaoke?

We do not stock a dedicated karaoke system, no lyrics display or console. What the Eco Pack gives you is real active speakers and a microphone, which covers the sound half of a karaoke night if you bring your own karaoke app or backing tracks on a laptop or phone. Tell us that is the plan when you book so our crew can confirm your device connects cleanly on arrival.

### How much does audio visual rental cost for a private party?

The Eco Pack costs 290 euros, ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout. The price includes delivery, setup and teardown. See exact pricing and the two optional add ons on our [packages page](/packages/).

### How far in advance should I book AV for a private party?

Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.

### How long has Malaga Event Gear been providing audio visual rental?

Backed by experience going back to 1996, three decades of live events across Malaga and the Costa del Sol.
